{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">LENGTH statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309956","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LENGTH-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LENGTH-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"LENGTH-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">LENGTH statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Changes the number of bytes in a raw variable.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LENGTH-statement__syntax_GC18TW2696005\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d139481e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LENGTH-statement__idGDM2L32672274\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>LENGTH ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">variable</var> ) = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">variable</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type RAW.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that returns an integer.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LENGTH-statement__example_GC18TX2696012\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d139481e154\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure takes the number of bytes in the name stored in the variable r1\nand truncates it to 2 bytes:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-rawln1.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LENGTH-statement__idGDM2L42672281\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>/* You must connect to a non-OpenEdge demo database to run this procedure */\nDEFINE VARIABLE r1 as RAW NO-UNDO.\n\nFIND Customer NO-LOCK WHERE Customer.CustNum = 29.\nr1 = RAW(Customer.Name).\n<strong class=\"ph b\">LENGTH(r1)</strong> = 2.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LENGTH-statement__notes_GC18TY2696018\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d139481e192\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">If <var class=\"keyword varname\">variable</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), it remains the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">If <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> is greater than the number\nof bytes in <var class=\"keyword varname\">variable</var>, the AVM appends null bytes\nso that the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">variable</var> equals the length\nof <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LENGTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-function.html\">LENGTH function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LIBRARY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LIBRARY-function.html\">LIBRARY function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309956","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"LENGTH statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-statement.html","type":"Manual"}